     A** AGENT LATE NOTICE WORK FILE
     A**
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PLN01                     TEXT('AGENT LATE NOTICE WORK FILE')
     A            LNCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            LNFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            LNAGT#    R               REFFLD(AGT#)
     A                                      COLHDG('AGENT #' 'ASSIGNED BY FUND')
     A            LNPROD    R               REFFLD(AGT#)
     A            LNEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            LNDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            LNAMT     R               REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('TOTAL AMT DUE')
     A            LNSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            LNUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            LNPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            LNTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            LNDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A*  ADDED FIELDS TO  SHOW AGING
     A            LNCURR    R               REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('CURRENT AMT DUE')
     A            LN30DY    R               REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('30 DAYS PAST DUE')
     A            LN60DY    R               REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('60 DAYS PAST DUE')
     A            LN90DY    R               REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('90+ DAYS PAST DUE')
